### Feature ProductType — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### JWT + RBAC (desde el ISS-13): requiere el token de un usuario con la concesión. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

# @name updateProductTypePut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electrónica Actualizada",
  "description": "Categoría renovada"
}

###
# @name updateProductTypePatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/product-types/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Descripción parcial"
}
